    "scenesThatPass": [
      "RENEE: You think? We went to three different Prada stores to find the right fit.\nLUCY: What do yo do for a living, Renee?\nRENEE: I paint. I'm in a band. I do volunteer work at a shelter. I teach ESL. I do balloon animal art. You know, a little of this, a little of that…",
      "LUCY: Do you rent or own?\nRENEE: I sublet. I have this corner of a loft.",
      "LUCY: If you're ever interested in buying, you should ring me up.\nRENEE: I hate owning things. Because when you own something, you suddenly are invested in that thing not breaking. And I break everything. I've gon…",
      "AIRLINE REP: That'll be twelve hundred and thirty three dollars.\nRENEE: Maybe we shouldn't do this."
    ]
